---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Hamare Baare Me" description="AapkaNeta.org ka mission: har neta ke kaam ka saboot-sahit hisaab, bina pakshpaat ke.">
  <style>
    .l-hero { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; padding: 44px 0; }
    .l-hero h1 { font-size: 32px; }
    .l-hero p { color: #cbd5e1; margin-top: 8px; max-width: 680px; }
    .l-block { margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .l-block h2 { font-size: 21px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .l-block p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15.5px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .l-block ul { margin: 10px 0 10px 22px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 15px; }
    .l-block li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  </style>

  <div class="l-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>About Us</h1>
      <p>Neta ko dekhte sab hain — unke <b>kaam</b> ka hisaab koi nahi deta. Hum wahi karte hain.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>Ye site kyun bani?</h2>
      <p>Chunav me vaade hote hain, jeetne ke baad khabrein band. Matdata ke paas ye jaanne ka koi tareeka nahi hota ki unke kshetra ke neta ne paanch saal me <b>asal me kya kaam kiya</b> — sadak bani ya nahi, paani aaya ya nahi, school bana ya nahi.</p>
      <p><b>AapkaNeta.org</b> is sawaal ka jawab deta hai — daavon par nahi, <b>dastavezon</b> par. Har neta ki profile par:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Halafnama record</b> — Election Commission ke naamankan halafname se: umr, shiksha, aaparaadhik mamle, sampatti, deynta.</li>
        <li><b>Kaam ka hisaab</b> — news reports, RTI jawab aur sarkari dastavezon se verified: udghatan, shilanyas, nidhi ke kaam, poore hue project.</li>
        <li><b>MP fund ka data</b> — MPLADS fund me kitna mila, kitna kharch hua (sarkari e-SAKSHI portal se).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>Hamara usool</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Saboot ke bina koi \"kaam\" list me nahi aata.</li>
        <li>Khali profile ka matlab \"record jama ho raha hai\" hai — kisi neta ke khilaf tippani nahi.</li>
        <li>Kisi party ya neta se paisa lekar listing — kabhi nahi.</li>
        <li>Vivaad wale section me dono paksh honge, agar uplabdh ho.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Puri methodology yahan padhein: <a href="/methodology/" style="color:#fbbf24">Hamari methodology</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>Humse judein</h2>
      <p>Ye project <b>FK Digital Media</b> (Firoz Khan) dwara chalaya jata hai. Updates, naye records aur RTI-related jaankari ke liye follow karein:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/rtibyfiroz/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Instagram — @rtibyfiroz</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card l-block">
      <h2>Sampark</h2>
      <p>Correction, sawal ya sujhav: <a href="/contact/" style="color:#fbbf24">Contact page</a> dekhein.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
